# Secrets belong in the local runtime directory, not this repository.
# WSL defaults to ~/.local/share/openjutsu.
# Export these variables in the process launching the server; no automatic dotenv load.
# The CLI defaults to localhost port 9780; use `serve --port NUMBER` to change it.
# OPENJUTSU_DATA_DIR=/home/your-user/.local/share/openjutsu
# OPENJUTSU_ML_PYTHON=/absolute/path/to/model-environment/bin/python
# OPENJUTSU_MODEL_DIR=/absolute/path/to/models
